@startuml Hartree-Fock Unified Algorithm (RHF, UHF, ROHF)

' ============================================================
' UNIFIED HARTREE-FOCK SCF ACTIVITY DIAGRAM - HIGH LEVEL VIEW
' Shows partition flow and data connections between components
' Detailed content in individual partition files
' Color coding: RHF=LightGreen, UHF=LightCoral, ROHF=LightYellow
' ============================================================

skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor White
skinparam ActivityBorderColor Black
skinparam DiamondBackgroundColor White
skinparam DiamondBorderColor Black

title Unified Hartree-Fock Self-Consistent Field Algorithm
caption High-Level Partition Flow with Data Connections

start

' ============================================================
' INITIALIZATION - Horizontal Band
' ============================================================
:══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
**INITIALIZATION** (See: initialization.puml)
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════; <<#LightBlue>>

:▲ **Input:**
• Molecular geometry (XYZ file)
• Basis set name (e.g., 6-31G)
• HF method (RHF/UHF/ROHF)
• Charge, multiplicity; <<#LightBlue>>

:Process atoms & basis set
Count electrons by method;

:▼ **Output:**
• atoms, basis_functions, n_basis
• RHF: <latex>N_{occ}</latex> | UHF: <latex>N_{\alpha}, N_{\beta}</latex> | ROHF: <latex>N_{closed}, N_{open}</latex>
• HF_method; <<#LightBlue>>

' ============================================================
' INTEGRAL COMPUTATION - Horizontal Band
' ============================================================
:══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
**INTEGRAL COMPUTATION** (See: integral_computation.puml)
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════; <<#LightCyan>>

:▲ **Input:**
• atoms, basis_functions from Initialization; <<#LightCyan>>

:Compute one & two-electron integrals
<latex>\mathbf{S}, \mathbf{T}, \mathbf{V} \rightarrow \mathbf{H}</latex>
ERI tensor, <latex>E_{nuc}</latex>;

:▼ **Output:**
• <latex>\mathbf{S}</latex> → SCF Initialization, SCF Iteration Loop, Post-SCF Analysis
• <latex>\mathbf{H}</latex> → SCF Initialization, SCF Iteration Loop
• ERI → SCF Iteration Loop
• <latex>E_{nuc}</latex> → Finalization; <<#LightCyan>>

' ============================================================
' SCF INITIALIZATION - Horizontal Band
' ============================================================
:══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
**SCF INITIALIZATION** (See: scf_initialization.puml)
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════; <<#PaleGreen>>

:▲ **Input:**
• <latex>\mathbf{S}</latex> from Integral Computation
• <latex>\mathbf{H}</latex> from Integral Computation
• <latex>N_{occ}/N_{\alpha}/N_{\beta}/N_{closed}/N_{open}</latex> from Initialization; <<#PaleGreen>>

:Compute <latex>\mathbf{X} = \mathbf{S}^{-1/2}</latex>
Initial guess: <latex>\mathbf{F} = \mathbf{H}</latex>
Diagonalize → initial <latex>\mathbf{C}, \boldsymbol{\varepsilon}</latex>
Build initial density matrices;

:▼ **Output:**
• <latex>\mathbf{X}</latex> → SCF Iteration Loop
• Initial <latex>\mathbf{C}</latex>, Density matrices → SCF Iteration Loop
• DIIS storage (initialized) → SCF Iteration Loop; <<#PaleGreen>>

' ============================================================
' SCF ITERATION LOOP - Horizontal Band
' ============================================================
:══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
**SCF ITERATION LOOP** (See: scf_iteration_loop.puml)
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════; <<#Khaki>>

:▲ **Input:**
• <latex>\mathbf{H}</latex>, ERI from Integral Computation
• <latex>\mathbf{X}</latex> from SCF Initialization
• Occupation numbers from Initialization
• DIIS storage; <<#Khaki>>

:Build Fock matrix
Compute <latex>E_{elec}</latex>, error, DIIS extrapolate
Check convergence
Transform, Diagonalize, Back-transform
Update density matrices;

:▼ **Output:**
• converged (bool), n_iterations
• <latex>E_{elec}</latex> → Finalization
• Final <latex>\mathbf{C}, \boldsymbol{\varepsilon}</latex> → Post-SCF Analysis, Finalization
• Final Fock, Density matrices → Finalization; <<#Khaki>>

' ============================================================
' POST-SCF ANALYSIS - Horizontal Band
' ============================================================
:══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
**POST-SCF ANALYSIS** (See: post_scf_analysis.puml)
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════; <<#LightPink>>

:▲ **Input:**
• <latex>\mathbf{C}</latex> from SCF Iteration Loop
• <latex>\mathbf{S}</latex> from Integral Computation
• <latex>N_{\alpha}, N_{\beta}</latex> from Initialization (UHF); <<#LightPink>>

:Spin contamination analysis
<latex>\langle\hat{S}^2\rangle</latex> calculation;

:▼ **Output:**
• <latex>\langle\hat{S}^2\rangle</latex> → Finalization
• spin_contamination (bool) → Finalization; <<#LightPink>>

' ============================================================
' FINALIZATION - Horizontal Band
' ============================================================
:══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
**FINALIZATION** (See: finalization.puml)
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════; <<#Thistle>>

:▲ **Input:**
• <latex>E_{elec}</latex> from SCF Iteration Loop
• <latex>E_{nuc}</latex> from Integral Computation
• <latex>\mathbf{C}, \boldsymbol{\varepsilon}</latex> from SCF Iteration Loop
• Fock, Density matrices from SCF Iteration Loop
• <latex>\langle\hat{S}^2\rangle</latex> from Post-SCF Analysis
• HF_method from Initialization; <<#Thistle>>

:<latex>E_{total} = E_{elec} + E_{nuc}</latex>
Create Wavefunction object
Package HartreeFockResult;

:▼ **Final Output:**
HartreeFockResult containing:
• <latex>E_{total}</latex>
• Wavefunction (RHF/UHF/ROHF type)
• All matrices
• Convergence metadata; <<#Thistle>>

stop

' ============================================================
' DATA FLOW SUMMARY & SYMBOL LEGEND
' ============================================================
legend right
    **Symbol Legend:**
    |= Symbol |= Description |
    | <latex>\mathbf{S}</latex> | Overlap matrix - measures basis function overlap |
    | <latex>\mathbf{T}</latex> | Kinetic energy matrix - electron kinetic energy |
    | <latex>\mathbf{V}</latex> | Nuclear attraction matrix - electron-nucleus interaction |
    | <latex>\mathbf{H}</latex> | Core Hamiltonian - one-electron energy operator |
    | <latex>\mathbf{F}</latex> | Fock matrix - effective one-electron operator |
    | <latex>\mathbf{P}</latex> | Density matrix - electron probability distribution |
    | <latex>\mathbf{C}</latex> | MO coefficient matrix - orbital expansion coefficients |
    | <latex>\mathbf{X}</latex> | Orthogonalization matrix - transforms to orthogonal basis |
    | <latex>\boldsymbol{\varepsilon}</latex> | Orbital energies - eigenvalues of Fock matrix |
    | ERI | Electron repulsion integrals - two-electron interactions |
    | <latex>E_{nuc}</latex> | Nuclear repulsion energy - nucleus-nucleus interaction |
    | <latex>E_{elec}</latex> | Electronic energy - total electron energy |
    | <latex>E_{total}</latex> | Total energy - sum of electronic and nuclear energies |
    | <latex>N_{occ}</latex> | Number of occupied orbitals (RHF) |
    | <latex>N_{\alpha}, N_{\beta}</latex> | Number of alpha/beta electrons (UHF) |
    | <latex>N_{closed}, N_{open}</latex> | Closed/open shell electron counts (ROHF) |
    | <latex>\langle\hat{S}^2\rangle</latex> | Spin expectation value - spin purity measure |
    | DIIS | Direct Inversion of Iterative Subspace - convergence accelerator |
    ----
    **Data Flow Summary:**
    |= Data |= From |= To |
    | atoms, basis_functions | Initialization | Integral Computation |
    | <latex>N_{occ}</latex> (RHF) | Initialization | SCF Initialization, SCF Iteration Loop |
    | <latex>N_{\alpha}, N_{\beta}</latex> (UHF) | Initialization | SCF Initialization, SCF Iteration Loop, Post-SCF Analysis |
    | <latex>N_{closed}, N_{open}</latex> (ROHF) | Initialization | SCF Initialization, SCF Iteration Loop |
    | <latex>\mathbf{S}</latex> | Integral Computation | SCF Initialization, SCF Iteration Loop, Post-SCF Analysis |
    | <latex>\mathbf{H}</latex> | Integral Computation | SCF Initialization, SCF Iteration Loop |
    | ERI | Integral Computation | SCF Iteration Loop |
    | <latex>E_{nuc}</latex> | Integral Computation | Finalization |
    | <latex>\mathbf{X}</latex> | SCF Initialization | SCF Iteration Loop |
    | <latex>\mathbf{C}, \boldsymbol{\varepsilon}</latex> | SCF Iteration Loop | Post-SCF Analysis, Finalization |
    | <latex>E_{elec}</latex> | SCF Iteration Loop | Finalization |
    | <latex>\langle\hat{S}^2\rangle</latex> | Post-SCF Analysis | Finalization |
    ----
    **HF Method Colors:**
    |<#LightGreen> RHF | Restricted Closed-Shell |
    |<#LightCoral> UHF | Unrestricted Open-Shell |
    |<#LightYellow> ROHF | Restricted Open-Shell |
endlegend

